msgstr "With festive cheer, the crowds draw near, to raise their glass to the holiday near! The sound of drums, and festive fun—the phenomenally phenomenal Goose is here!"

msgid "ny25_blogger02/LastName"
msgstr "?empty?"

msgid "ny25_blogger02/Name"
msgstr "TalkToMerryMoose"

